MAJOR_VERSION=4
STANDARD_VERSION=5
RELEASE_VERSION=0
RELEASE_DATE=2026-09-14
DESCRIPTION=Add a fail-closed x86-64 freestanding BIOS boot candidate with long-mode entry, BSS/stack setup, early IDT diagnostics, initialized COM1 marker, truthful subsystem capabilities, schema-v2 browser compatibility metadata, and a tested browser lifecycle/readiness controller that cannot signal ready before the exact serial marker. Add pinned QEMU WebAssembly browser boot with verified disk hashes, native QMP lifecycle control, guest VGA text-memory rendering, independent browser validation, and reproducible runtime installation. Restyle the browser lab with a CRT bezel, status badge, and phosphor console so the probe UI is no longer a plain document.
